    {
      "id": "47dfw_bvP9UchK_xTMoqL",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -107.37847721752523,
      "y": 765.51781597004,
      "width": 560,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2V",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1538535831,
      "version": 93,
      "versionNonce": 1926246361,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1771572873549,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "如果把它配置成一个高质量的过滤器就会变成一个强大的工具；\n会自动为你筛选出世界上最精选的信息",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "如果把它配置成一个高质量的过滤器就会变成一个强大的工具；\n会自动为你筛选出世界上最精选的信息",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Kvzk86gN897VazzM1OaTv",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -148.45266894720785,
      "y": 837.235924055894,
      "width": 540,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2W",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 589952183,
      "version": 62,
      "versionNonce": 1938541849,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1771572940998,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "危险：\n大部分人会因为当时的冲动和情绪导致整个推荐系统变成一个\n信息茧房，更助力一些不合理的想法",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "危险：\n大部分人会因为当时的冲动和情绪导致整个推荐系统变成一个\n信息茧房，更助力一些不合理的想法",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "KgBMi8M40v_DLeh9auiDV",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 609.8755017520335,
      "y": -476.18050838609514,
      "width": 870,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2Y",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 770049689,
      "version": 301,
      "versionNonce": 1572416055,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1771573110799,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "学习伟大的产品，公司的发展历程（与时代，科技变革的关系），\n卓越的创业（创新）者的如何理解和看待世界，改变世界",
      "fontSize": 30,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "学习伟大的产品，公司的发展历程（与时代，科技变革的关系），\n卓越的创业（创新）者的如何理解和看待世界，改变世界",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
