      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "在这里的沟通公司内部并没有一个很完善的知识库",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "在这里的沟通公司内部并没有一个很完善的知识库",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "oYd7jCui9ToGGHDNZ7E66",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 301.5473312438692,
      "y": 1507.829256278364,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3p",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1435766841,
      "version": 34,
      "versionNonce": 677624407,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1771577254543,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "所以一般做的好的是个人拥有自己完善的知识库和交流体系",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "所以一般做的好的是个人拥有自己完善的知识库和交流体系",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "-M8tfS7cVx3Nc12lq1Lao",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 301.5473309469599,
      "y": 1538.5280450560006,
      "width": 722,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3q",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 582186297,
      "version": 135,
      "versionNonce": 2144886489,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1771577301440,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "所以在商家这一方能发现你有非常好的知识体系(更专业)的时候会更愿意和你合作",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "所以在商家这一方能发现你有非常好的知识体系(更专业)的时候会更愿意和你合作",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
